{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introducing BEATSMITH: The Custom Music Editor for BEATABLE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BEATSMITH</strong> is the beautifully designed Custom Music Editor for the hand-tracking rhythm game, <strong>BEATABLE</strong>. With this all-in-one tool, you can effortlessly create, share, and install custom music directly into your game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features Include:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-in-one Design: Pack your audio data, album cover, and all difficulty levels into a single file.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time Note Map Design: Design your note maps on the fly with real-time recording.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy Installation: A built-in helper tool simplifies installing custom music onto your Meta Quest headset.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and many more features waiting for you to discover!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Join our community and connect with other creators via our Discord link!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886500?t=1757244883","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886500?t=1757244883","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886500/507886c624f76408639a9e0c612c1868bcce35cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757244883","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886500/507886c624f76408639a9e0c612c1868bcce35cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757244883","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introducing BEATSMITH: The Custom Music Editor for BEATABLE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragr